ion are the methods for gathering and measuring information in a research. These tools extract data on variables from an established individual, group or situation. It is essential to have some objectives and a hypothetical question, which you answer to evaluate the outcomes.</div>"}, {"time": "27000", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob12re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<div align=\"justify\">These processes permit to get and organize data from primary and secondary sources, which are the different tools that you should use in any research. Then, you analyze the information in order to make informed decisions that can affect companies, and it also classifies patterns in a business.</div>"}, {"time": "49000", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob12re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<div align=\"justify\">You can use the following tools to collect information. Firstly, the observation, which collects data where and when an event or activity is occurring; however, some people don't behave naturally when someone else observe them. Secondly, the document review and analysis that collect data from written sources. Thirdly, the interview which gathers information directly from the participant, and it is very useful for gaining insight and context into a topic. Then, the questionnaires, which collect information and data from written questions. These can be open or closed questions. Finally, you can find focus groups, which collect data, information, and opinions of a group. However, someone can lead the discussion over the other participants, so sometimes you don't get the results that you want. As well, you can find the case studies, which collect information from a person, group or situation.</div>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n1le02ob12re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 3, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n1le02ob12re5vsc01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}]}, "type": "video"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}